WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.327
JAMIE: Is that an infrastructure
move, or a hedge

00:00:02.327 --> 00:00:04.654
JAMIE: against the cloud providers
they depend on?

00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:07.724
RUFUS: Both, I think. And that's
rather the point.

00:00:07.724 --> 00:00:10.709
RUFUS: Anthropic's S-1 disclosed a
large monthly services contract

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:13.695
RUFUS: for computing through May
twenty twenty-nine. That's the

00:00:13.695 --> 00:00:16.680
RUFUS: existing dependency. The
turbines may be the beginning

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.665
RUFUS: of an exit from it.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.447
JAMIE: So they're buying their way
toward independence.
